    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "You're now on the free version of MindSync. Everything you've saved stays saved, and the free limits reset on the 1st of every month. If you didn't mean to stop, for example because a payment didn't go through, check your App Store or Google Play subscription, or hit reply and I'll help."
